//   - The D2 RESOLVER SHAPE is CANONICAL regardless of where the
//     type ultimately lives. The fan-out (python/go/cpp/ts) must
//     not redeclare GroundingMap locally — that is the P2
//     violation cascade. Fan-out files defer D2a(2) under the
