//     candidate homes under escalation (placement-first-hold,
//     rust-as-shared-authority, new shared extdeps resolver file).
//     Co-drafted tradeoff analysis surfaced to T-4 mgr by
//     loyal-koi-702 + merry-ibex-337 (D2 author).
//
